 the sidewalk staying level across them), full-height curbs with no lowered section, and storm drain inlets. Return one tight bounding box per curb ramp. Do not box driveways, stairs, or crosswalk paint. If there are no curb ramps, return an empty list. For each box, also give a score from 0 to 100 for how confident you are that it is a curb ramp. Use the whole range: 50 means you are unsure.","provider":"gemini","response_schema":"{\"items\": {\"properties\": {\"box_2d\": {\"description\": \"[ymin, xmin, ymax, xmax], normalized 0-1000\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"integer\"}, \"type\": \"array\"}, \"label\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"score\": {\"maximum\": 100, \"minimum\": 0, \"type\": \"integer\"}}, \"propertyOrdering\": [\"box_2d\", \"label\", \"score\"], \"required\": [\"box_2d\", \"label\", \"score\"], \"type\": \"object\"}, \"type\": \"array\"}","source_max_edge":4096,"tile":true,"views":[[0.0,-30.0,90.0,90.0,1024,1024],[60.0,-30.0,90.0,90.0,1024,1024],[120.0,-30.0,90.0,90.0,1024,1024],[180.0,-30.0,90.0,90.0,1024,1024],[240.0,-30.0,90.0,90.0,1024,1024],[300.0,-30.0,90.0,90.0,1024,1024]]}}